              "text": "சூறாவளி — cūṟāvaḷi — \"a cyclone; a whirlwind\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சூறாவளியில் பல மரங்கள் விழுந்தன. cūṟāvaḷiyil pala maraṅkaḷ viḻuntaṉa. Many trees fell in the cyclone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சூறை alone also names a whirlwind."
            }
          ]
        },
